  "instructions": [
    "Combine sugar, rice vinegar, and water in a sous-vide cooker at 150°F (65°C) for 4 hours.",
    "Heat sesame oil in a pan over medium heat and sauté garlic and black pepper until fragrant.",
    "Add rice to the pan and stir-fry for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the sous-vide mixture to the pan and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Optional: add lactic acid to enhance fermentation.",
    "Let the mixture rest for 30 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve warm or at room temperature.",
    "Store leftovers in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 3 days."
